 29-KlondikeDerby2027\n\nSafeguarding Youth / YPT\n\nThe Klondike Derby is
  a day of fun and friendly competition in the snow (or mud\, or sun—you
  never know with Midwest winters). Troops compete against each other in a
 ctivities like fire building\, sled racing\, and first aid\, carrying all
  their supplies on a troop-designed sled.\nThis is one of our most popula
 r Scouts BSA and Venturing crew activities. Arrow of Light Scouts may att
 end as guests of a troop.\nSafeguarding Youth Training required:\nAll adu
 lt participants must provide their SYT completion 
